    "salary_growth_trajectory": "Direct recruitment through the Nagaland Staff Selection Board (NSSB) Combined Staff Recruitment Examination (CSRE / CSEE) appoints candidates to non-gazetted, non-technical and technical Group-C posts such as Junior Divisional Accountant, Storekeeper, LDA cum Computer Assistant, Assistant Jailor, and Sub-Inspector of Excise across Nagaland Government departments in Pay Matrix Level 5 (₹25,500 – ₹81,100) or Level 4 (₹21,700 – ₹69,100) under the Nagaland Services (ROP) Rules 2017. Employees advance through departmental quotas and seniority to Senior Divisional Accountant / Senior Assistant (Level 7), Divisional Accounts Officer / Superintendent (Level 10), Senior Accounts Officer / Assistant Director (Level 12), and Joint Director (Level 13).",
